# Response headers for every file Cloudflare serves (copied into out/ at build).
#
# X-Frame-Options / frame-ancestors: no other site may embed ClinicStock in a
#   frame. Without this, a hostile page could overlay invisible "Issue stock"
#   buttons under its own (clickjacking) while the user is signed in.
# nosniff: the browser must trust our Content-Type, not guess one.
# Referrer-Policy: other sites never see our full URLs (they carry ?id=...).
# Permissions-Policy: the app needs no camera, microphone or location.
#
# A full Content-Security-Policy is NOT set yet: Next.js injects inline
# scripts, so a strict CSP needs hashes generated per build. Recorded as a gap
# in docs/DEPLOYMENT.md rather than shipped half-working.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
